-- token.txt --
sk-team-token-0001
-- help.txt --
AIGW  aigw client
────────────────────────────────────────
  List, enable and disable clients

Usage
  aigw client [command]

Commands
  disable              Disable a client and remove AIGW-owned projections
  discover             Discover installed client executables
  enable               Enable a client projection
  list                 List every client with its model, whether it is enabled and where it is installed

Options
  -h, --help   help for client
-- disabled.txt --
AIGW  Client disabled
────────────────────────────────────────
  Client               Claude
  ✓ All AIGW-owned projections were safely removed
-- enabled.txt --
AIGW  Client enabled
────────────────────────────────────────
  Client               Claude
  ✓ Projection         Configured

Next
  aigw check
-- refusal.txt --
AIGW  Action required
────────────────────────────────────────

Problem
  Client must be claude, claude-desktop, codex, or hermes; run `aigw client enable --help`: invalid argument "unknown" for "aigw client enable"

Fix
  aigw client enable --help
